<title>USA: Learning Tree holders vote to increase shrs.</title>
<headline>Learning Tree holders vote to increase shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Learning Tree International Inc said Tuesday shareholders at the annual meeting March 7 approved an increase in authorized common shares to 75 million from 25 million.</p>
</text>
